  "source": "## Semantics: C3, K1, K2, B1, B2, B3, A1, A3, M0\ngrammar ConformanceTypes version \"1.0.0\" {\n  ## A year: four digits, cast to integer.\n  main = 4*( %x30-39 ) as year\n\n  bindings main {\n    year -> year (integer)\n  }\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    example \"2020\" { year: 2020 }\n    reject \"20a0\"\n    reject \"123\"\n  }\n}\n",
